stent and non-circular.\n5. The alternative gems-in-BLUE possibility would require B1 to be true only because BLUE itself is true, a circular self-support, so it is not a valid determined solution.\n\nFINAL: gem=WHITE; B1=T; W1=F; K1=T"}
