HITE: W1 = TRUE, K1 = TRUE, B1 = FALSE → has at least one true and one false. Valid.\n- Gems in BLUE: W1 = FALSE, K1 = FALSE, B1 = FALSE → all false. Invalid.\n- Gems in BLACK: W1 = FALSE, K1 = FALSE, B1 = FALSE → all false. Invalid.\n\nTherefore the gems must be in WHITE.\n\nFINAL: gem=WHITE; B1=F; W1=T; K1=T"}
