st be false.  \nWith K1 true but B1 false, the top-statement claim is not true for every box, so W1 is also false.  \nThis gives: BLUE all-false, WHITE all-false, BLACK all-true, satisfying the required true-box and false-box conditions.\n\nFINAL: gem=BLUE; B1=F; B2=F; W1=F; K1=T"}
